{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261120/photo/bkn-20261120124928428-1120_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261120132122\"/><p>事發在英皇道131號中國銀行。(吳鎮興攝)</p><p>北角有人行使偽鈔。今日(20日)早上11時47分，英皇道131號中國銀行職員報案，指有兩男女到上址存入100張面額為100美元鈔票，職員查驗時發現鈔票全屬同一號碼。警員接報到場，經初步調查後，以涉嫌「行使偽製紙幣」，拘捕兩男女，二人現正被扣留調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T05:43:58.688915+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T04:49:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T05:37:26.627789+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T05:37:26.627789+00:00","content_hash":"f1d570f0a583428748bdbed6c4ed66843468c638f611051b23fe80edc71ba9f6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}